      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon appears just before someone\npasses away, so it’s feared as an emissary\nof death.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "誰かが　死ぬ　直前に\n現れる　ことから　死神の使い\nとして　恐れられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由于它会在人类临终时出现，\n人们认为它是死神的\n使者，对它畏惧不已。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es considerado y temido como Pokémon de\nmal agüero, ya que aparece en los instantes\nprevios al fallecimiento de alguien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ランプの　ふりをして　まちなかに\nひそむ。　しきが　ちかい　ひとを\nみつけると　そっと　あとを　つける。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "램프인 척 마을 안으로\n숨어든다. 죽음이 다가온 사람을\n발견하면 조용히 뒤를 쫓는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "偽裝成燈的樣子藏身在城鎮裡。\n一旦發現了臨近死期的人，\n便會悄悄地跟在後面。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se cache en ville en se faisant passer pour\nun lampadaire. Lorsqu’il repère une personne\ndont l’heure est proche, il la suit en catimini.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es gibt sich als Lampe aus und lungert in Städten\nherum. Entdeckt es einen Menschen, dessen\nTodesstunde naht, folgt es ihm leise.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se oculta en entornos urbanos haciéndose pasar\npor una lámpara corriente. Si se topa con alguien\nmoribundo, lo sigue en silencio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si mimetizza nel paesaggio cittadino fingendosi\nuna lampada. Quando incontra una persona\nprossima alla morte, la segue silenzioso.",
      "language": {
